message: "If you use this monograph, its code or its data, please cite it as below."
title: "Algebraic Genomics: The Combinatorics of Sequence Reconstruction and Representation"
abstract: >-
  Exact Eulerian reconstruction, double-stranded spectral fibres, sandpile groups, and the
  computational complexity of sequence space. The monograph collects the Bio papers 1-19
  (Bio 15, 16 and 18 were dropped) and one co-authored paper, each with a verification script
  that reproduces its numbers.
